cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt these materials, please cite them as below and also credit Ian McNicoll's openEHR workshop."
title: "openEHR building blocks workshop"
abstract: >-
  A paper building-block workshop on openEHR template modelling. Participants
  build the Nursing Admission Assessment template from printed archetype plates
  and building blocks, then author a new archetype (Inpatient admission
  details) with write-on blocks. No computers or internet are needed on the day.
